{"text": "Senior DevOps Engineer with 7 years of experience building scalable cloud infrastructure and observability platforms. At BetaInternal, led the integration of Prometheus and Grafana into multi-cloud environments, improving incident detection time by 67%. Designed and maintained GKE clusters on GCP using Terraform, reducing deployment errors by 41%. Prior to that, at GridEngine, managed Azure-based microservices, leveraging Linux and GCP to streamline logging pipelines and cut operational costs by 23%. Earlier role at EdgeLabs involved optimizing cluster autoscaling and monitoring with Grafana dashboards, enhancing system uptime to 99.95%. Experienced in infrastructure-as-code and cloud automation, with a strong focus on reliability and performance.\n\nSkills: Grafana, Azure, GCP, GKE, Prometheus, Terraform, Linux", "domain": "devops_platform", "seniority": "Senior", "years_experience": 7, "skills": ["Grafana", "Azure", "GCP", "GKE", "Prometheus", "Terraform", "Linux"]}
